[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Independent MOS1 audit polarity and differential admission

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: AUDIT-MOS1-POLARITY-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Preserve NMOS and PMOS terminal-current signs under reversal and translation
STATEMENT: >>>
Independent MOS1 current audits shall preserve channel polarity, drain/source
orientation and common-mode translation of terminal voltages. Known memoryless
triode currents shall satisfy DC and stationary backward-Euler KCL and power
with default audit tolerances. At zero body bias a finite body-effect
coefficient shall not shift the channel threshold. Corrupting a supplying
current shall fail audit.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Verification: tests/audit_mos_polarity.rs nmos_pmos_and_reversed_terminals_agree_with_known_triode_current
and current_conservation_survives_common_mode_polarity_and_orientation.
Zero-body trace: zero_body_bias_has_no_shift_with_nonzero_body_effect_coefficients.
The independent 57.75 microamp fixture follows the closed-form triode law,
without evaluating production model current or Jacobian. Three offsets and
both polarities/orientations plus96 Proptest cases, seed2026111908.
This qualifies the bounded memoryless audit fixture, not general MOS physics.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: AUDIT-MOS1-DIFFERENTIAL-ADMISSION-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Reject each unrepresentable MOS voltage differential before continuation
STATEMENT: >>>
Finite MOS terminal potentials shall not imply representable physical voltage
differences. An independently overflowing channel span or body bias shall
produce InvalidInput before downstream span/overdrive min/max or bounded body continuation can turn
unknown physics into a passing cutoff state. DC and stationary backward-Euler
audits shall enforce these independent domain checks for both polarities.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Verification: body_overflow_is_refused_even_with_finite_zero_channel_span and
channel_span_overflow_is_refused_even_with_finite_body_bias. Bare MOS circuits
avoid incidental ideal-source tolerance overflows masking the admission test.
These are finite-arithmetic malformed-state tests, not solved circuit decks.
Implementation: src/audit.rs independent_mos1_current, unchanged by this checkpoint.
<<<
